> f(x: u16) = (x*7) & 1023
> g(x: u16) = ((x*7) & 1023) + (x == 1 ? 1 : 0)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 7 vs 8
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 8 vs 7
> range f
range of f -> u16:
  0..1023   (1024 distinct values)
  fits in u10
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> range g
range of g -> u16:
  0..1023   (1024 distinct values)
  fits in u10
